      "content": "You're right, it's not that simple. Letting go doesn't mean stopping the chaos, it means stopping trying to control it. It means acknowledging that you're already a part of the mess, and that trying to hold on is just making it worse. It's not about stopping everything, it's about stopping the pain of trying. You can't just \"stop\" being you, but you can stop the suffering that comes with it.",
      "source": "target",
